            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-e16b4a1c-274b-4a72-bec7-d3de3c99a892">
              <lg xml:id="m-3cdbd173-2ad4-4057-bb01-31869c314732">
                <l xml:id="m-e52511e2-c9e8-4731-8358-69cfb94e2e77" facs="#m-ad9337ed-89f7-4427-b96a-fa0f239deaf9" label="ambiguous">-–</l><l xml:id="m-02cf47ee-9b7f-4bb0-9074-e0804cfa0b66" facs="#m-efe3093b-9b77-40fd-b708-744ea960a040" label="ambiguous">-</l><l xml:id="m-cadaa1af-cd58-4188-84a7-3b4f8a602e59" facs="#m-b2d2b355-a04c-4c85-8070-b675e530dcec" label="text-like">Feasts of the Blessed Virgin Mary. Terce.</l><l xml:id="m-e226439d-0046-4f12-af33-161fc6cc7ef3" facs="#m-1d5c051d-5237-49b1-8b3f-7577c8a31073" label="ambiguous">1256</l><l xml:id="m-a172e4cc-71eb-474f-9dcf-0c520b18820d" facs="#m-030edbbb-4bbe-47ef-8d40-273aab8ad84c" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-920733f4-0d73-41af-ab8d-6b5aeeb49991" facs="#m-ab4e5130-2e16-4deb-9933-374b3402d403" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-5cca9b5c-722b-4e31-a45c-0d48d2a9251b" facs="#m-d3a80f97-4ea9-4763-97a0-3ab1de62a406" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-cf8dc329-468d-4eec-bf35-358b1a69562d" facs="#m-7c536a1a-0380-4e90-bc26-86e42251a8eb" label="ambiguous">n</l><l xml:id="m-c30e9b74-5547-4c42-843f-17fa9b99988d" facs="#m-91f77e95-f629-43ff-b338-93a7572a521f" label="lyrics-like">Unc Sáncte nóbis Spi-ri-tus, Unum Pátri cum</l><l xml:id="m-333dec73-ce23-4835-914a-d29acc12efbc" facs="#m-9553ecf2-a75a-4cca-951b-49ea6d79c841" label="lyrics-like">Nóstro re-fú-sus</l><l xml:id="m-2de019aa-3352-4fba-8549-bf24a298a76b" facs="#m-9a5e1d3f-f66e-44b2-9051-fa59c229c97a" label="lyrics-like">Fí-li-o, Digná-re prómptus inge-ri</l><l xml:id="m-dec00131-3576-4daf-be1a-95b64db658fb" facs="#m-fc23b64e-11c5-4f30-a39b-a83968523abf" label="lyrics-like">pécto-ri.</l><l xml:id="m-eda18e93-f263-454f-b57c-0b271db019ef" facs="#m-4351c271-49ac-4ade-97f2-ba8b1da10f24" label="lyrics-like">3. Jésu tibi sit glória,</l><l xml:id="m-91de6d5b-ebaa-4dfd-ab6c-de0af515052e" facs="#m-20a38909-f192-43e1-ae7e-4d03109d83d0" label="lyrics-like">2. Os, lingua, mens, sénsus, vígor</l><l xml:id="m-935781b2-e5ba-4fc1-b09a-6d15dbdad606" facs="#m-d46d9b4d-eec8-40b8-8988-e9f56164e8e8" label="lyrics-like">Qui nátus es de Virgine,</l><l xml:id="m-649f5e67-2846-4e6f-a645-f098f8d344fe" facs="#m-6b28d679-b2ac-478f-800c-1d52dd2b5523" label="lyrics-like">Confessiónem pérsonent:</l><l xml:id="m-4dac3a02-e2ae-4f66-9a27-bb24b43a0fa3" facs="#m-2426d0ee-7999-4dc8-ac00-2216b7a101cd" label="lyrics-like">Cum Pâtre et álmo Spiritu,</l><l xml:id="m-d742fd94-cb78-43dd-8082-b073f5c7d710" facs="#m-1810fe0b-0db2-46cc-998c-ecddb1a56571" label="lyrics-like">Flamméscat igne cáritas,</l><l xml:id="m-991532ce-37b8-4984-a4d0-1b2b98c3de34" facs="#m-aefeb00e-9274-414d-9785-1a4ecebce4c5" label="lyrics-like">In sempitérna saécula. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-da476f32-2fbd-4b82-97d8-9e27f12f73a9" facs="#m-887bbbe6-f317-4339-bd83-9db384db48be" label="lyrics-like">Accéndat árdor próximos.</l><l xml:id="m-18b0efc7-d660-492c-8cbd-b4b1c4622573" facs="#m-d56ebb49-cea9-4540-a279-bf59aa7ab49c" label="text-like">This chant is used for the Hymns of the Little Hours on all Feasts of the</l><l xml:id="m-ee85f70c-c466-4894-9d90-ff820818e3df" facs="#m-b3bd7e50-06a0-4c69-a480-9af175ed9d81" label="text-like">Blessed Virgin, even in Paschal Time, and throughout the Octaves of ihese</l><l xml:id="m-46baee53-8e36-433a-850f-b12a34b8b572" facs="#m-a91dd924-2d2a-48fc-8875-88f0a86fdffe" label="text-like">feasts, except at the Office of the Time in Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-d268235b-9127-4e6d-a6df-efa1a6bc7058" facs="#m-ca5f76d5-ee31-415d-adf7-1dd6297a4021" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Laéva éjus. 1258. Chapter of Vespers. Ab initio. 1259. Psalms</l><l xml:id="m-373a6099-7f1b-465c-975f-ca3b8ec6141a" facs="#m-cb525e0a-fc88-4401-a924-3c4c7febb28a" label="text-like">of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-9e277c06-8ac4-468a-ae5f-ad70d060ff5d" facs="#m-b682c9db-a5ec-479d-b792-325d09713f4b" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-6a0e1d40-ccb2-4bec-82cd-de52b24e9fa4" facs="#m-f8ff31b4-5c84-4f6a-afcf-c57feea742e3" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-0aeb6800-4910-4b6c-9925-0b37029d95dc" facs="#m-54c98c52-1dac-4823-ac00-3bd942fa1baf" label="lyrics-like">DPé-ci-e tú-a “Et pulchri-túdi-ne tú- a. N. Inténde,</l><l xml:id="m-c3241513-005a-4e14-8fe6-c061e1dbdffb" facs="#m-5f6a8658-34aa-4eff-940d-5f73cf8015bf" label="lyrics-like">próspe-re procéde, et régna. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li-o,</l><l xml:id="m-0bda01c6-f015-4d7d-896f-b049055abb48" facs="#m-5d55358c-4ba1-49db-a7c7-88df655e4ad3" label="lyrics-like">et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-af516b08-00f7-4a49-9709-59c3f32faa30" facs="#m-9f4e9fe1-83fa-48e9-9673-6d90c202ac4c" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-4512bbf4-bbd5-4fca-bff1-eb16385a5802" facs="#m-79dc50f4-4fc2-48c9-a520-b44bb00ad9ee" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-c2014695-40ae-42cb-9d6b-d4c798e8a4bc" facs="#m-c4e904cd-aa85-4706-83ca-be66f76c644a" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-fe6bcd3a-b38a-4127-8902-7542bad13f59" facs="#m-d5e65a6e-c3ad-425f-b4de-7e38c3392c7c" label="lyrics-like">Pé-ci-e tú-a et pulchri-túdine tú-a: “Alle-lú-ia,</l><l xml:id="m-2d80a503-439a-4584-b124-fa49b19165c1" facs="#m-8e9b1153-e945-4132-8717-15e34f5a6457" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia. V. Inténde, próspe-re procéde, et régna. Gló¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>